---
/**
 * @category Metrics
 * @theme starquix
 * @name Metrics3
 */
---
<section class='bg-stone-50 px-4 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28 xl:px-16 xl:py-32 dark:bg-stone-900'>
  <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 md:gap-16 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-8'>
    <div class='flex flex-col gap-5 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between md:gap-10 xl:col-span-5 xl:flex-col xl:items-start xl:justify-between xl:gap-6'>
      <h2 class='m-0 font-sans text-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] text-stone-900 text-balance md:text-6xl xl:text-[4rem] dark:text-stone-50'>Snadno se čte, snadno se ovládá</h2>
      <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty md:max-w-sm dark:text-stone-400'>Každá sekce v knihovně dodržuje stejná pravidla pro kontrast, velikost textu a dotykové plochy, ve světlém i tmavém režimu.</p>
    </div>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-stone-200 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgb(28_25_23/0.06),0_16px_40px_-16px_rgb(28_25_23/0.18)] ring-1 ring-stone-200 md:grid-cols-2 xl:col-span-7 dark:bg-stone-700 dark:ring-stone-700'>
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 bg-white p-6 md:p-8 dark:bg-stone-800'>
        <p class='m-0 pb-3 font-sans text-6xl font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.05em] text-stone-900 md:text-7xl dark:text-stone-50'>4.5:1</p>
        <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Minimální kontrast textu</h3>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Úroveň WCAG 2.2 AA pro běžný text.</p>
      </div>
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 bg-white p-6 md:p-8 dark:bg-stone-800'>
        <p class='m-0 flex items-baseline gap-1 pb-3 font-sans'><span class='text-6xl font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.05em] text-stone-900 md:text-7xl dark:text-stone-50'>14</span><span class='text-2xl font-light text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>px</span></p>
        <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Nejmenší velikost textu</h3>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Včetně popisků a drobného písma.</p>
      </div>
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 bg-white p-6 md:p-8 dark:bg-stone-800'>
        <p class='m-0 flex items-baseline gap-1 pb-3 font-sans'><span class='text-6xl font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.05em] text-stone-900 md:text-7xl dark:text-stone-50'>44</span><span class='text-2xl font-light text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>px</span></p>
        <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Nejmenší dotykový cíl na telefonu</h3>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Tlačítka a odkazy snadno trefíte palcem.</p>
      </div>
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 bg-white p-6 md:p-8 dark:bg-stone-800'>
        <p class='m-0 flex items-baseline gap-1 pb-3 font-sans'><span class='text-6xl font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.05em] text-stone-900 md:text-7xl dark:text-stone-50'>375</span><span class='text-2xl font-light text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>px</span></p>
        <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Nejužší obrazovka</h3>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Každé rozvržení začíná na malém telefonu a odtud se rozšiřuje.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
